            "objective": "Talk to Sister Victoria",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "190010101",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "I sure hope Sister Barbara is okay..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010102",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "What's happened to Barbara?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010103",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "Sister Barbara said that she was going out to pick some herbs earlier, but I'm afraid that she has yet to return."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010104",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "Hmm... Perhaps I should report the matter to the Knights of Favonius..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010105",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I'll go search for Barbara."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010106",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "You? Well, I guess as the Honorary Knight, you may very well be a good fit for the task..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010107",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "Not to mention it would save me the trouble of reporting the matter to the Knights..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010108",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "Alright, I'll leave it to you. Before Sister Barbara departed, she said that she was headed to Wolvendom to pick some herbs."
                },
                {
                    "id": "190010109",
                    "speaker": "Victoria",
                    "text": "You could start by looking for her there."
                }
            ]
        },
